{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/2c5350ec67a3d4fcbbc42b311781a55d.poster.avif?t=1770825175\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/2c5350ec67a3d4fcbbc42b311781a55d.webm?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/2c5350ec67a3d4fcbbc42b311781a55d.mp4?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Willow, a 13-year-old girl awakening in a twisted realm. Your brother is lost, your heart is heavy, and your resolve to find him is as strong as ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Interim.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hospital where time and reality drift out of place, solve atmospheric puzzles, and face moral choices that shape who you become \u2014 a compassionate guide for others, or a lone survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with unsettling yet well-meaning patients, learn their stories, and venture deeper into ever-changing halls. Gather forgotten memories and make your way toward the heart of the hospital, where something important has been waiting for you all along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander and Remember</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic point-and-click storytelling, where progress comes from observation, curiosity, and clever use of found objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a variety of whimsical mini-games: duel a knight made of junk, play wolves a lullaby, or help a blind girl mend her broken mirror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imagination. In a world where memories shape reality, puzzles often demand faith in the impossible to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect memories of your journey in the form of photographs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/6bf51ca42263390c7544063b324c120c.poster.avif?t=1770825175\" width=800 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/6bf51ca42263390c7544063b324c120c.webm?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/6bf51ca42263390c7544063b324c120c.mp4?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911320?t=1770825175","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911320?t=1770825175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/e3b3447a70e58d3a08b61304444700c1f0b16a3f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770825175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/e3b3447a70e58d3a08b61304444700c1f0b16a3f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770825175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/2c5350ec67a3d4fcbbc42b311781a55d.poster.avif?t=1770825175\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/2c5350ec67a3d4fcbbc42b311781a55d.webm?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/2c5350ec67a3d4fcbbc42b311781a55d.mp4?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Willow, a 13-year-old girl awakening in a twisted realm. Your brother is lost, your heart is heavy, and your resolve to find him is as strong as ever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Interim.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hospital where time and reality drift out of place, solve atmospheric puzzles, and face moral choices that shape who you become \u2014 a compassionate guide for others, or a lone survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speak with unsettling yet well-meaning patients, learn their stories, and venture deeper into ever-changing halls. Gather forgotten memories and make your way toward the heart of the hospital, where something important has been waiting for you all along.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wander and Remember</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience classic point-and-click storytelling, where progress comes from observation, curiosity, and clever use of found objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter a variety of whimsical mini-games: duel a knight made of junk, play wolves a lullaby, or help a blind girl mend her broken mirror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your imagination. In a world where memories shape reality, puzzles often demand faith in the impossible to be solved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect memories of your journey in the form of photographs.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/6bf51ca42263390c7544063b324c120c.poster.avif?t=1770825175\" width=800 height=700 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/6bf51ca42263390c7544063b324c120c.webm?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/extras/6bf51ca42263390c7544063b324c120c.mp4?t=1770825175\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Blooming Bats Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911320/c2ccf9be73e54dd51ada480eaf0755738cc28f18/header.jpg?t=1770825175","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6300U CPU @ 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) HD Graphics 5500 (Broadwell GT2)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6300U CPU @ 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) HD Graphics 520<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911320/392353458/e8446c487451808f31d7b1f9089db4b7c9a5b373/1764238647/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764239060","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911320/392353458/e8446c487451808f31d7b1f9089db4b7c9a5b373/1764238647/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764239060","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/391132